msgctxt "answer"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

msgctxt "answer"
msgid "Almost certainly"
msgstr "거의 확실해요"

msgctxt "answer"
msgid "Highly debatable"
msgstr "글쎄요, 의견이 많이 갈릴 것 같네요"

msgctxt "answer"
msgid "I do not know"
msgstr "모르겠어요"

msgctxt "answer"
msgid "I do not want to answer"
msgstr "대답하고 싶지 않아요"

msgctxt "answer"
msgid "Insanity is doing the exact same thing over and over again, expecting things to change. That is insanity."
msgstr "똑같은 일을 계속 반복하면서 결과가 달라지기를 바라는 것. 그게 바로 광기죠."

msgctxt "answer"
msgid "It is decided"
msgstr "이미 정해졌어요"

msgctxt "command"
msgid "Magic 8-ball: ask any question"
msgstr "매직 8볼: 무엇이든 물어보세요"

msgctxt "answer"
msgid "Maybe"
msgstr "그럴 수도 있어요"

msgctxt "answer"
msgid "More likely yes"
msgstr "그럴 가능성이 더 높아요"

msgctxt "answer"
msgid "No!"
msgstr "아니요!"

msgctxt "answer"
msgid "Probably not"
msgstr "아마 아닐 거예요"

msgctxt "answer"
msgid "Sorry, I am too busy for pointless conversation today"
msgstr "미안하지만, 오늘은 쓸데없는 이야기를 나누기엔 너무 바빠요"

msgctxt "answer"
msgid "Yes!"
msgstr "네!"

msgctxt "answer"
msgid "You are one of those people who are a pleasure to say goodbye to"
msgstr "당신은 작별 인사를 할 때 참 기분이 좋아지는 사람이네요"

msgctxt "answer"
msgid "You are one of those people who are a pleasure to talk to"
msgstr "당신은 함께 이야기하면 참 기분이 좋아지는 사람이네요"

msgctxt "answer"
msgid "You should not have asked"
msgstr "묻지 않는 게 나았을 거예요"
